6550\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Train Dreams\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Based on the beloved novella by Denis Johnson, Train Dreams is the moving portrait of Robert Grainier (Edgerton), whose life unfolds during an era of unprecedented change in early 20th-century America.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Based on the beloved novella by Denis Johnson, Train Dreams is the moving portrait of Robert Grainier (Edgerton), whose life unfolds during an era of unprecedented change\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"moderate violence, threat, sex\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-11-07\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":102,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":4,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000161\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001039\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001516\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004240\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006665\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008151\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008438\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009524\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009528\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011787\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012514\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012515\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012516\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"85f2ffb9-a3e6-437c-b922-52ecdaa5292b\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006550\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008091\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Black Bear\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006677\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Hamnet\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"From Academy Award\u00ae winning writer/director