nion, ensuing love affair, and the music they collect and preserve, will shape the course of Lionel\u2019s life far beyond his own awareness.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Two young men during World War I set out to record the lives, voices and music of their American countrymen.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"brief strong sex\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":128,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E2PSkw8BI7k\",\"displayPriority\":3,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002283\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002310\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004336\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007164\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007677\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008293\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012816\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012817\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012818\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012819\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012820\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012821\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012822\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000033\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"c8ef0b42-7ed8-4ee1-9534-85771b63b7fc\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006687\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008252\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Universal Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006689\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"No Other Choice\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"After being unemployed for several years, a man devises a unique plan to secure a new job: eliminate his competition.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"After being unemployed for several years, a man devises a unique plan to secure a new job: eliminate his competition.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":139,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012169\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012827\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012828\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012829\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012830\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012831\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000026\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"9ecc0908-a983-42f7-9591-6f8d73d7488b\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006689\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008255\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"MUBI\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006691\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Is This Thing On?\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"As their marriage quietly unravels, Alex seeks new purpose in the New York comedy scene while Tess confronts the sacrifices she made for their family \u2014 forcing them to navigate co-parenting, identity, and whether love can take a new form.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"As their marriage quietly unravels, Alex seeks new purpose in the New York comedy scene while Tess confronts the sacrifices she made for their family.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-30\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":121,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ngmu5zGOa7s\",\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002276\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003003\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003138\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006446\